        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 学生科研/创新创业项目评审 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 教育部《国家级大学生创新创业训练计划管理办法》",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://hudong.moe.gov.cn/srcsite/A08/s5672/201907/t20190724_392132.html",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：国家级大学生创新创业训练计划；项目遴选、过程管理、结题验收、学校实施细则等。具体校内项目批次以当年通知为准。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-007",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学2026年第一批大学生创新训练计划拟立项公示",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-008",
            "text": "- 来源：https://aao.cdut.edu.cn/info/1248/7044.htm",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-009",
            "text": "- 适用范围：该批次公示及流程背景，不构成下一批申报资格、评分标准或经费限额。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-010",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-011",
            "text": "教育部办法给出国家计划管理框架；具体立项名额、评分表和本校经费限额以当年校内通知及主管单位确认件为准。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-012",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-014",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 13
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-015",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 14
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk9xxc-v1-block-016",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 15
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
